		</span>
	</div>
	<table style='margin-top:1em; border-collapse:collapse; width:800px; table-layout:fixed;' width='800' border='1' cellspacing='0' cellpadding='0'>
		<tr>
			<td style='border:1px solid #808080; padding:3px 6px; vertical-align:top; background:#f2f2f2; font-weight:bold;' colspan='2'>
				<div class='notes-par'>
					<span style='font-weight:bold;'>分析</span>
				</div>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style='border:1px solid #808080; padding:3px 6px; vertical-align:top;' colspan='2'>
				<div class='notes-par'>
					<span style='font-weight:bold;'>影響範囲：</span>
					<span class='notes-field-wrap'>
						<span class='notes-field' data-field='Fd_Id_1' data-type='keyword' data-allowmultivalues='true'>ＮＦＰ</span>
					</span>
				</div>
